          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_5",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baran",
            text: _("Greetings, brother, and welcome home."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("Hail."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baran",
            text: _("Is that all, Arvith? I understand, but..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("You called, and I came; be content with that. What ails Maghre?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baran",
            text: _("A dark mage has come upon us; his creatures call him Mordak. They have been terrorizing outlying farms, and we fear they may soon attack the village itself! The villagers of Maghre have taken up weapons but they are not trained fighters; we need your men, and you to lead them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baran",
            text: _("I can feel Mordak’s foul touch on the hidden currents of the earth and air. He is somewhere due north of here, I would say not more than two days’ ride."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("All right. I will do this for the village. Can you keep the mage off our backs?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baran",
            text: _("I will go stealthily with a handful of our best scouts and woodsmen. While you demonstrate against him and kill his creatures, I will try to defeat Mordak himself with magic at an unguarded moment. You shall be the right hand, I the left... aye, brother?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("... Aye. Just make sure you’re there when we need you."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "recruit",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_recruit_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "s1_failed_achievement",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_7",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 6,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("Baran should be in position by now. Press them, distract the adept so Baran can spring his trap!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 10,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("Baran has not made his attack!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mercenary",
            text: _("Could he have abandoned us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("No... No. This is something else. I’m worried about him... but right now it means we have to deal with this Mordak ourselves."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_9",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Mordak%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Argh!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("Good work, men! But what has become of my brother?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Worried about him, are you? E-he-he... hergh... gaargh..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Mordak",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("There’s nothing more to be had from this one; we will have to search for Baran ourselves!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Reporter",
            text: _("Sir, our scouts report that Baran was seen captured and carried away further north!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arvith",
            text: _("That they should dare this! We will give chase at once."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "who_slew_mordak",
            value: "$second_unit.id",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_11",
        on: "branch_if_11",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "s1_failed_achievement",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_achievement",
            id: "heroes_of_maghre",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_12",
        on: "branch_if_12",
        once: true,
